        array("id" => "s3e7", "season" => 3, "number" => 7, "name" => "Obsession", "airdate" => "18 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The match finally reaches the final set, which will be won by whoever gets 15 points first. Keishin sees that Kageyama is exhausted, and switches him out with Sugawara. Sugawara had always only done attacks that he knew would work for sure, but after the Toky…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/85/213144.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e8", "season" => 3, "number" => 8, "name" => "An Annoying Guy", "airdate" => "25 Nov 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Because Tsukishima's hand was injured, Karasuno's block isn't as strong, so they decide to go after Shiratorizawa with forceful attacks. Meanwhile, Hinata's play finally makes Ushijima feel like he's worth playing against.Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/86/215664.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e9", "season" => 3, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Volleyball Freaks", "airdate" => "2 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Shiratorizawa gets a match point, which puts Karasuno in a very difficult position, but then Tsukishima manages to come back. All of the players are at the end of their ropes, but they continue to give their all to the last part of the match!Source: crunchyro…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/87/218457.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e10", "season" => 3, "number" => 10, "name" => "The Battle of Concepts", "airdate" => "9 Dec 2016", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The score of the final set finally enters the 20's. Shiratorizawa shows off individual strengths, and Karasuno continues to be reckless. Despite their methods being different, this is a battle between very similar teams.Who will win in the end?Source: crunchy…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/88/220905.jpg"),
