        array("id" => "s4e7", "season" => 4, "number" => 7, "name" => "Return", "airdate" => "21 Feb 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Karasuno holds their practice match against Date Tech. Karasuno has a hard time dealing with the best blockers in the prefecture. Kageyama gets frustrated and ends up yelling at the spikers who aren't able to get hits in. Seeing that, Hinata...Source: crunchy…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304168.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e8", "season" => 4, "number" => 8, "name" => "Challenger", "airdate" => "28 Feb 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The practice match against Date Tech before the Spring Tournament is about to come to an end. Each member of Karasuno tries to better themselves personally. Will they be able to acquire a new weapon and evolve as a team?Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304170.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e9", "season" => 4, "number" => 9, "name" => "Everyone's Night", "airdate" => "6 Mar 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The new year has come and the members Karasuno High School Volleyball team were nervous. The long-awaited battle on the orange court, the Spring Tournament, was finally here!Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304171.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e10", "season" => 4, "number" => 10, "name" => "Battle Lines", "airdate" => "13 Mar 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Spring Tournament had finally begun. But as soon as the first match was about to begin, Hinata realizes his shoes are gone. The team panics at the unexpected incident, but their manager, Shimizu...Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304172.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e11", "season" => 4, "number" => 11, "name" => "A Chance to Connect", "airdate" => "20 Mar 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "In the first match at the Spring Tournament, Karasuno faces off against Tsubakihara Academy. At first, Kageyama isn't able to get used to the new venue, but once he got the hang of things, he and Hinata do their quick attack and the crowd is in awe. Karasuno…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304173.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e12", "season" => 4, "number" => 12, "name" => "Vivid", "airdate" => "27 Mar 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Karasuno manages to make it to the second round after their victory against Tsubakihara Academy. Meanwhile, Hinata runs into Hoshiumi Korai, one of the players from Kamomedai High School who went to the All Japan youth camp that Kageyama went to. Hinata witne…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304174.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e13", "season" => 4, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Second Day", "airdate" => "3 Apr 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The second day of the Spring Tournament. Karasuno faces the team that placed second at the Inter-High and one of the favorites to win the Spring Tournament, Inarizaki High School. The team also has the best twins in high school volleyball, the Miya twins. Kar…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304175.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e14", "season" => 4, "number" => 14, "name" => "Rhythm", "airdate" => "2 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The match with Inarizaki High at the Spring Tournament finally begins. Karasuno is overpowered by the supreme Miya Twins and the Inarizaki cheer section taking over the venue. It was then that a certain someone arrived in the stands...Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304176.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e15", "season" => 4, "number" => 15, "name" => "Found", "airdate" => "9 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Karasuno is able to regain their rhythm with Saeko's help, but the Miya Twins weirdo quick gives Inarizaki the lead. How will Karasuno deal with this unexpected turn of events?Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304177.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e16", "season" => 4, "number" => 16, "name" => "Broken Heart", "airdate" => "16 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Because of Yamaguchi's service ace at the end of the first set, Karasuno is able to get set point first. However, Inarizaki then starts targeting Tanaka, who seems a bit off his game. How will Tanaka deal with this pressure?Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304178.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e17", "season" => 4, "number" => 17, "name" => "Cats vs Monkeys", "airdate" => "23 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "In their match against Inarizaki, Karasuno manages to take the first set. Meanwhile on another court, Nekoma High School was going up against Ishikawa's team, Sarukawa Tech. They're both known for their defense. Who will come out the victor?Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304179.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e18", "season" => 4, "number" => 18, "name" => "Trap", "airdate" => "30 Oct 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Nekoma and Sarukawa Tech both show no signs of slowing down. They realize that Sarukawa is trying to wear down Kenma's stamina, so Kenma comes up with a plan...Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304181.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e19", "season" => 4, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Ultimate Challengers", "airdate" => "6 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Nekoma High School moves to the 3rd round after defeating Sarukawa High School. Meanwhile, Karasuno and Inarizaki head into their second set and Miya Atsumu starts to target Nishinoya with his serves.Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304183.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e20", "season" => 4, "number" => 20, "name" => "Leader", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Karasuno starts to break down Inarizaki's dominance with Kageyama's serves. And to counter that, Inarizaki sends in their captain, Kita Shinsuke to get their rhythm back.Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304184.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e21", "season" => 4, "number" => 21, "name" => "Hero", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Things intensify even more in the 3rd set against Inarizaki. Karasuno has a hard time dealing with Miya Atsumu's serves and Suna's quicks and then send in the pinch server, Kinoshita.Source: crunchyroll", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/521/1304186.jpg"),
